  coachSafety: row(["Moenie jou PIN, wagwoord of OTP hier deel nie. Net papiergeld. Nie finansiële advies nie.", "Ungabelani nge-PIN, iphasiwedi noma i-OTP lapha. Imali yephepha kuphela. Akusona iseluleko sezimali.", "Ungabelani nge-PIN, iphaswedi okanye i-OTP apha. Imali yephepha kuphela. Asilucebiso lwezemali.", "Ungabelani nge-PIN, iphasiwedi noma i-OTP lapha. Imali yephepha kuphela.", "Ungabelani nge-PIN, liphasiwedi noma i-OTP lapha. Imali yephepha kuphela.", "U se ke ua arolelana PIN, password kapa OTP mona. Chelete ea pampiri feela. Ha se keletso ea lichelete.", "O se ke wa abelana PIN, phasewete goba OTP mo. Tšhelete ya pampiri feela. Ga se keletšo ya tšhelete.", "O se ka wa abelana PIN, password kgotsa OTP mo. Madi a pampiri fela. Ga se keletso ya madi.", "U nga avelani PIN, phasewete kumbe OTP la. Male ya phepha ntsena. A hi xileriso xa timali.", "Ni songo kovhekanya PIN, phasiwede kana OTP hafha. Masheleni a bammbiri fhedzi. A si tshivhudzo tsha masheleni.", "Never share your PIN, password or OTP here. Paper money only. Not financial advice."]),
  coachCredit: row(["Nee. Geleende geld is nie oorskot nie. Moet nooit ’n lening of mashonisa-geld in aandele sit nie.", "Cha. Imali ebolekiwe akuyona eseleyo. Ungalokothi ufaka imali yemashonisa emasheyeni.", "Hayi. Imali ebolekiweyo asiyoseleyo. Ungaze ufake imali yemashonisa kwizabelo.", "Cha. Imali ebolekiwe akuyona eseleyo. Ungafaki imali yemashonisa emasheyeni.", "Cha. Imali lebolekiwe akusiyo lesele. Ungafaki imali yemashonisa emasheyeni.", "Che. Chelete e alimoang ha se e setseng. U se ke ua kenya mokoloto kapa mashonisa liabong.", "Aowa. Tšhelete ye adimilwego ga se ye šetšego. O se ke wa tsenya mokoloto goba mashonisa diabeng.", "Nnyaa. Madi a adimilweng ga se a setseng. O se ka wa tsenya mokoloto kgotsa mashonisa diabeng.", "E-e. Male leyi kokeriwaka a hi leyi salaka. U nga nghenisi mokoloto kumbe mashonisa eka swiphemu.", "Hai. Masheleni o adzimwaho a si zwo salaho. Ni songo dzhenisa mokoloto kana mashonisa kha zwipida.", "NO. Borrowed money is not leftover. Never put a loan or a mashonisa's money into shares."]),
  coachNoLeftover: row(["Sit hierdie week. Daar is geen oorskot ná huur en rekeninge nie, so niks om te belê nie. Sit is hoe die rekening oorleef.", "Hlala phansi kuleli viki. Ayikho eseleyo ngemva kwerenti nezikweletu, ngakho akukho okuzotshalwa. Ukuhlala phansi yindlela i-akhawunti esinda ngayo.", "Hlala phantsi kule veki. Akukho eseleyo emva kwerenti namatyala, ngoko akukho kotyalwa. Ukuhlala phantsi yindlela iakhawunti esinda ngayo.", "Hlala phansi kulo viki. Ayikho eseleyo ngemva kwerenti. Ukuhlala phansi yindlela i-akhawunti esinda ngayo.", "Hlala phansi kuliviki. Ayikho lesele ngemva kwerenti. Kuhlala phansi yindlela i-akhawunti esinda ngayo.", "Lula bekeng ena. Ha ho e setseng ka mor'a rente le likoloto, kahoo ha ho letho leo u ka le tsetelang. Ho lula ke mokhoa oa ho pholosa akhaonte.", "Dula bekeng ye. Ga go na ye šetšego ka morago ga rente le melato. Go dula ke mokgwa wa go phološa akhaonte.", "Nna fatshe bekeng eno. Ga go na a setseng morago ga rente le makoloto. Go nna fatshe ke mokgwa wa go pholosa akhaonte.", "Tshama evhikini leri. A ku na leyi salaka endzhaku ka rente na swikweleti. Ku tshama i ndlela akhawunti yi ponisaka ha yona.", "Dzulani kha vhege iyi. A huna zwo salaho nga murahu ha rente na zwikolodo. U dzula ndi ndila ine akhaunte ya tshidza ngayo.", "SIT this week. There is no leftover after rent and bills, so there is nothing to invest. Sitting is how the account survives."]),
  coachSitPattern: row(["Jy het nou {leftover} oorskot, maar jou patroon sê volgende week kan die rekeninge knyp. Hou dit in Main en Spaargeld. Beleggingslimiet volgende week: R0.", "Unayo {leftover} eseleyo manje, kodwa iphethini yakho ithi iviki elizayo lingacindezela izikweletu. Yigcine ku-Main nase-Savings. Umkhawulo wokutshala iviki elizayo: R0.", "Unayo {leftover} eseleyo ngoku, kodwa ipateni yakho ithi iveki ezayo inokucinezela amatyala. Yigcine ku-Main nase-Savings. Umda wotyalo-mali weveki ezayo: R0.", "Unayo {leftover} eseleyo manje, kodwa iphethini ithi iviki elizayo lingacindezela. Yigcine ku-Main nase-Savings. Umkhawulo: R0.", "Unayo {leftover} lesele nyalo, kodvwa iphethini itsi liviki lelitako lingacindzetela. Ligcine ku-Main nase-Savings. Umkhawulo: R0.", "U na {leftover} e setseng hona joale, empa mokhoa oa hau o re beke e tlang e ka hatella likoloto. E boloke ho Main le Polokelo. Moeli oa tsetelo bekeng e tlang: R0.", "O na le {leftover} ye šetšego bjale, eupša mokgwa wa gago o re beke e tlago e ka gatelela melato. E boloke go Main le Polokelo. Moedi wa tsetelo: R0.", "O na le {leftover} a setseng jaanong, mme mokgwa wa gago o re beke e tlang e ka gatelela makoloto. A boloke mo Main le Polokelo. Moedi wa tsetelo: R0.", "U na {leftover} leyi salaka sweswi, kambe ndlela ya wena yi vula leswaku vhiki leri taka ri nga cindzetelela swikweleti. Yi hlayise eka Main na Ntsako. Nkatsakanyo wa ntshalo: R0.", "Ni na {leftover} zwo salaho zwino, fhedzi ndila yanu i ri vhege i tevhelaho i nga tsikeledza zwikolodo. Zwi vhulungeni kha Main na Vhulunga. Mukano wa vhutseteli: R0.", "You have {leftover} leftover now, but your pattern says next week could squeeze the bills. Keep it in Main and Savings. Investment cap next week: R0."]),
  coachLightLead: row(["Size liggies.", "Linganisa kancane.", "Linganisa kancinci.", "Linganisa kancane.", "Linganisa kancane.", "Leka hanyane.", "Leka ganyane.", "Leka ganye.", "Pima switsongo.", "Elani zwihuku.", "SIZE lightly."]),
  coachGoLead: row(["Jy mag size, binne die limiet.", "Ungalinganisa, ngaphakathi komkhawulo.", "Ungalinganisa, ngaphakathi komda.", "Ungalinganisa, ngaphakathi komkhawulo.", "Ungalinganisa, ngekhatsi kwemkhawulo.", "U ka lekanya, ka har'a moeli.", "O ka lekanya, ka gare ga moedi.", "O ka lekanya, mo gare ga moedi.", "U nga pima, endzeni ka nkatsakanyo.", "Ni nga ela, nga ngomu ha mukano.", "YOU may size, within the cap."]),
  coachSize: row(["{lead} Oorskot hierdie week is {leftover}. Jou hoofgeld het {landed} van die laaste {weeks} weke geland. Beperk beleggings tot {cap} en hou {aside} in Main en Spaargeld.", "{lead} Eseleyo yaleli viki ingu-{leftover}. Imali yakho enkulu ifike {landed} kwamaviki angu-{weeks} okugcina. Khawula ukutshala ku-{cap} ugcine {aside} ku-Main nase-Savings.", "{lead} Eseleyo yale veki ngu-{leftover}. Imali yakho ephambili ifike {landed} kweeveki ezingu-{weeks} zokugqibela. Nciphisa utyalo-mali ku-{cap} ugcine {aside} ku-Main nase-Savings.", "{lead} Eseleyo yalo viki ingu-{leftover}. Imali enkulu ifike {landed} kwamaviki angu-{weeks}. Khawula ukutshala ku-{cap} ugcine {aside} ku-Main nase-Savings.", "{lead} Lesele laleliviki lingu-{leftover}. Imali lenkhulu ifike {landed} kwemaviki langu-{weeks}. Khawula kutjala ku-{cap} ugcine {aside} ku-Main nase-Savings.", "{lead} E setseng ea beke ena ke {leftover}. Chelete ea hau e kholo e fihlile {landed} ho libeke tse {weeks} tsa ho qetela. Thibela tsetelo ho {cap} u boloke {aside} ho Main le Polokelo.", "{lead} Ye šetšego ya beke ye ke {leftover}. Tšhelete ya gago e kgolo e fihlile {landed} go dibeke tše {weeks} tša mafelelo. Thibela tsetelo go {cap} o boloke {aside} go Main le Polokelo.", "{lead} A setseng a beke eno ke {leftover}. Madi a gago a magolo a fihlile {landed} go dibeke tse {weeks} tsa bofelo. Thibela tsetelo go {cap} o boloke {aside} mo Main le Polokelo.", "{lead} Leyi salaka ya vhiki leri i {leftover}. Male ya wena leyikulu yi fikile {landed} eka mavhiki ya {weeks} yo hetelela. Siyela ntshalo eka {cap} u hlayisa {aside} eka Main na Ntsako.", "{lead} Zwo salaho zwa vhege iyi ndi {leftover}. Masheleni anu mahulwane o swika {landed} kha vhege dza {weeks} dza u fhedza. Thivhelani vhutseteli kha {cap} ni vhulunge {aside} kha Main na Vhulunga.", "{lead} Leftover this week is {leftover}. Your main money landed {landed} of the last {weeks} weeks. Cap investments at {cap} and keep {aside} in Main and Savings."]),
